# Federal & State Account Registry

**Last updated**: YYYY-MM-DD

Cross-entity index of IRS, SSA, and state registration accounts. **Credentials live in the password manager, never here.** Track what exists; point to where passwords are stored.

Legend: ✅ enrolled · 🔶 not enrolled (consider) · ❌ not applicable · ❓ unknown, verify

---

## IRS Federal Accounts

### EIN (Employer Identification Number)

| Entity | EIN | CP-575 letter location |
|---|---|---|
| `<entity>` | `<EIN>` | `entities/<slug>/corporate/formation/` |

### IRS Business Tax Account (irs.gov/businesses/online-account)
Per-EIN online portal: balance, payment history, notices, transcripts.

| Entity | Enrolled? | Enrollment date | Password mgr entry | Responsible officer |
|---|---|---|---|---|

### EFTPS (eftps.gov)
Federal business-tax payment rail. Required for any entity paying 1120 (incl. §6655 quarterly estimates) / 941 / 940 / 1099 withholding.

| Entity | Enrolled? | Enrollment date | PIN location | Internet password location |
|---|---|---|---|---|

### IRS IRIS TCC (Transmitter Control Code)
Required to e-file 1099s / 1042-S directly. Alternative: third-party transmitter (tax1099.com, Track1099).

| Entity | TCC | Active since | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|

### SSA BSO (Business Services Online)
Required to e-file W-2s. Only relevant once an entity has W-2 employees.

| Entity | Enrolled? | Notes |
|---|---|---|

### FinCEN BOIR

| Entity | Filed? | Date | Report location |
|---|---|---|---|

### Individual-level

| Account | Status | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| IRS Individual Online Account (irs.gov/account) | ❓ | For 1040 balance, estimated-tax history, transcripts |
| ID.me (id.me) | — | Gateway to IRS/SSA online services |

