## Minimum Viable Setup Checklist (per regarded entity)

- [ ] EIN
- [ ] IRS Business Tax Account enrolled
- [ ] EFTPS enrolled
- [ ] State DOR registered (home state + any foreign qualification)
- [ ] State SOS in good standing
- [ ] FinCEN BOI applicability verified under current official authority:
      U.S.-created entities are currently exempt under the final rule effective
      August 14, 2026; foreign-law entities registered in the United States
      require a separate current-rule filing/exemption analysis
- [ ] IRS IRIS TCC (only if issuing 1099s directly; otherwise use a transmitter)

Individual:
- [ ] ID.me verified
- [ ] IRS Individual Online Account

