## Enrollment quick reference

| Account | URL | Time to activate |
|---|---|---|
| EIN | irs.gov/ein (SS-4 online) | Immediate |
| IRS Business Tax Account | irs.gov/businesses/online-account | Same-day after ID.me |
| EFTPS | eftps.gov → Enrollment | 7–10 business days (PIN mailed) |
| IRS IRIS TCC | irs.gov/e-file-providers/iris-application-for-tcc | 2–4 weeks |
| SSA BSO | ssa.gov/bso | Same-day after ID.me |
| ID.me | id.me | 15–30 min |
| State DOR | state DOR portal | Same-day to a few days |
| State SOS | state SOS filing portal | Same-day after formation |

