## Notes

- Never put credentials in this file. Last-4 only if referencing account numbers.
- `bank-accounts.md` indexes financial accounts; this file is registration accounts. Two separate registries.
- Anti-duplication: detail lives here; each entity's `entity.md` has a one-line "see `workspace-profile/federal-accounts.md`."
